        <briefdescription>
<para>Register a callback for the RTC interval timer (RTCTEV). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Configures the interval at which the RTCTEV interrupt fires and registers a callback to be invoked on each event. Pass <computeroutput>callback</computeroutput> as NULL to disable the interval timer.</para>
