        <briefdescription>
<para>Register a callback for a prescaler timer (RT0PS or RT1PS). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Configures the periodic interrupt interval for the selected prescaler timer and registers a callback to be invoked on each event. Pass <computeroutput>callback</computeroutput> as NULL to disable the prescaler timer interrupt.</para>
<para>Use values from <ref refid="group__ti__mspm0__rtc__interface_1ga4a6d625dbf8f123816b7a84bf1fd9617" kindref="member">rtc_mspm0_rt0ps_interval</ref> when <computeroutput>timer</computeroutput> is <ref refid="group__ti__mspm0__rtc__interface_1gga89da157290a9b51fc774699523efd892a8fd3088ecaa648bc1aea16070fad4c2a" kindref="member">RTC_MSPM0_PS_TIMER_0</ref>, and values from <ref refid="group__ti__mspm0__rtc__interface_1gad8476c7435663e9d1a3b1abf9e38e14e" kindref="member">rtc_mspm0_rt1ps_interval</ref> when <computeroutput>timer</computeroutput> is <ref refid="group__ti__mspm0__rtc__interface_1gga89da157290a9b51fc774699523efd892a522485e5d5245347520ec28a477ffca4" kindref="member">RTC_MSPM0_PS_TIMER_1</ref>.</para>
